% BEGIN of inlined logic: the rules of the decision checkResult, below, copy
% the business knowledge model spouse id of the imported model BDT
% (BDT.dmn).
% The copy keeps this program in one file. You may want to move the copied
% logic to a separate file of its own, and include that file in this program
% and in the other programs that use it ("the knowledge base ... includes
% these resources").
rule check_result_1 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is true if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 1 of the check result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and it is not the case that
        the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M <= 33500.

condition 1 of the check result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

rule check_result_2 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is true if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 2 of the check result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M <= 41500.

condition 2 of the check result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

rule check_result_3 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is false if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 3 of the check result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and it is not the case that
        the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M > 33500.

condition 3 of the check result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

rule check_result_4 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is false if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number
        or the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or condition 4 of the check result is holds
    and the applicant and spouse income of the situation is a number M
    and the relationships of the situation include a type with a person id with a related person id
        and the primary person id of the situation is a text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the type is equal to "spouse"
    and M > 41500.

condition 4 of the check result is holds if
    it is not the case that the relationships of the situation are listed
    or it is not the case that the primary person id of the situation is a text.

